            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@zeitchef, should be implemented now. Add these vim commands to your init file (wrap each with `vim.cmd('...')` if inside Lua) to meet your case:\r\n```vim\r\nhi! link MiniCursorword Visual\r\nhi! MiniCursorwordCurrent gui=nocombine guifg=NONE guibg=NONE\r\n```\r\n\r\nBy the way, this ended up being my favorite type of feature request: reasonable, interesting and nicely fitting in current code. Thank you once again!",
